netic Diversity</source><year>2006</year><publisher-name>Gland, Switzerland, WWF Arguments for protection series</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B40"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lane</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A Global Initiative to Conserve Crop Wild Relatives <italic>In Situ</italic></article-title><source>BGjournal</source><year>2005</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>2</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B41"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Raymond</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name></person-group><source>Crop wild relatives</source><year>2006</year><publisher-name>Rome, Italy, Bioversity International</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>